        "_brand_page": {
          "version": 3,
          "body": "<style>\n:root {--wine: #631525;--wine-dark: #3e0b16;--wine-soft: #8a2439;--wine-light: #f5ebeb;--ivory: #faf6f0;--ivory-surface: #f3ece1;--ivory-card: #fdfbf7;--ivory-border: #e6dcce;--ink: #2b2220;--ink-muted: #6f625f;--accent-gold: #ab814e}\n\n* {box-sizing: border-box;margin: 0;padding: 0}\n\nbody {background-color: var(--ivory);color: var(--ink);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Noto Serif SC\", serif;line-height: 1.8;padding-bottom: 90px;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased}\n\nmain {width: 100%}\n\na {color: inherit;text-decoration: none}\n\n/* 顶部文眼标线 */\n.masthead-stripe {border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ivory-border);padding: 14px 24px;display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: center;font-size: 0.85rem;letter-spacing: 0.08em;color: var(--ink-muted);text-transform: uppercase}\n\n.masthead-stripe span:last-child {color: var(--wine);font-weight: 600}\n\n/* 首屏：海报式超大字号 */\n.poster-hero {position: relative;padding: 40px 24px 70px;max-width: 1280px;margin: 0 auto;border-bottom: 2px solid var(--wine);overflow: hidden}\n\n.poster-meta {display: flex;justify-content: space-between;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ivory-border);padding-bottom: 16px;margin-bottom: 30px;font-size: 0.9rem;color: var(--ink-muted)}\n\n.poster-title-wrap {margin: 20px 0 30px;text-align: left}\n\nh1.poster-title {font-size: clamp(5.2rem, 17vw, 15rem);line-height: 0.88;font-weight: 900;letter-spacing: -0.04em;color: var(--wine);display: block;word-break: break-all}\n\n.poster-subtext {display: grid;grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 28px;margin-top: 36px}\n\n@media (min-width: 860px) {\n  .poster-subtext {grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;gap: 60px;align-items: end}\n}\n\n.poster-lead {font-size: 1.35rem;line-height: 1.6;color: var(--wine-dark);font-weight: 500;border-left: 2px solid var(--wine);padding-left: 20px}\n\n.poster-col-note {font-size: 0.95rem;color: var(--ink-muted);line-height: 1.75}\n\n/* 专栏章节通用结构 */\n.essay-section {max-width: 1200px;margin: 80px auto;padding: 0 24px}\n\n.section-label {display: inline-block;font-size: 0.78rem;text-transform: uppercase;letter-spacing: 0.16em;color: var(--wine);font-weight: 700;margin-bottom: 8px}\n\n.section-title {font-size: 2rem;line-height: 1.3;color: var(--wine-dark);margin-bottom: 24px;font-weight: 800}\n\n.essay-prose {font-size: 1.05rem;color: var(--ink);line-height: 1.9;margin-bottom: 36px;max-width: 820px}\n\n/* 带有左侧色条标记的通用卡片 */\n.stripe-card {background: var(--ivory-card);border: 1px solid var(--ivory-border);border-left: 5px solid var(--wine);padding: 28px 28px 26px;transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-left-color 0.2s ease}\n\n.stripe-card:hover {border-left-color: var(--wine-soft)}\n\n.card-tag {font-size: 0.75rem;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: var(--wine);text-transform: uppercase;margin-bottom: 8px}\n\n.stripe-card h3 {font-size: 1.25rem;color: var(--wine-dark);margin-bottom: 12px;line-height: 1.4}\n\n.stripe-card p {font-size: 0.95rem;color: var(--ink-muted);line-height: 1.7}\n\n/* 专栏分论点网格 */\n.manifesto-grid {display: grid;grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 24px}\n\n@media (min-width: 768px) {\n  .manifesto-grid {grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr)}\n}\n\n/* 套餐：阶梯式递进排列 (Staircase) */\n.staircase-wrapper {margin-top: 48px;display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 28px}\n\n@media (min-width: 992px) {\n  .staircase-wrapper {display: grid;grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap: 24px;align-items: start;padding-top: 20px}\n\n  /* 阶梯递进视觉高差 */\n  .step-tier-1 {transform: translateY(60px)}\n  .step-tier-2 {transform: translateY(20px)}\n  .step-tier-3 {transform: translateY(0)}\n}\n\n.plan-card {background: var(--ivory-card);border: 1px solid var(--ivory-border);border-left: 6px solid var(--wine);padding: 36px 30px;position: relative;box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(99, 21, 37, 0.04)}\n\n.plan-card.featured {border-left: 8px solid var(--wine-dark);background: #fffdfa;box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(99, 21, 37, 0.09)}\n\n.plan-step-num {font-size: 0.8rem;font-family: monospace;color: var(--accent-gold);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.1em;margin-bottom: 6px}\n\n.plan-name {font-size: 1.6rem;color: var(--wine-dark);margin-bottom: 6px;font-weight: 800}\n\n.plan-desc-note {font-size: 0.88rem;color: var(--ink-muted);margin-bottom: 22px;min-height: 44px}\n\n.plan-price-box {border-top: 1px dashed var(--ivory-border);border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--ivory-border);padding: 16px 0;margin-bottom: 24px}\n\n.plan-price {font-size: 2.2rem;font-weight: 800;color: var(--wine);line-height: 1.1}\n\n.plan-annual {font-size: 0.85rem;color: var(--ink-muted);margin-top: 4px}\n\n.plan-features-list {list-style: none;margin-bottom: 30px}\n\n.plan-features-list li {font-size: 0.92rem;color: var(--ink);padding: 8px 0;border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(230, 220, 206, 0.4);position: relative;padding-left: 18px}\n\n.plan-features-list li::before {content: \"—\";position: absolute;left: 0;color: var(--wine);font-weight: bold}\n\n.plan-action-btn {display: block;text-align: center;padding: 14px 20px;font-size: 0.95rem;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.06em;color: var(--ivory);background-color: var(--wine);border: 1px solid var(--wine);transition: background-color 0.2s ease}\n\n.plan-action-btn:hover {background-color: var(--wine-dark)}\n\n.plan-card.featured .plan-action-btn {background-color: var(--wine-dark)}\n\n/* 使用规约与客户端配置 */\n.client-dispatch-panel {display: grid;grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 24px;margin-top: 32px}\n\n@media (min-width: 860px) {\n  .client-dispatch-panel {grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr}\n}\n\n.step-flow {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 18px}\n\n.step-item {background: var(--ivory-card);border: 1px solid var(--ivory-border);border-left: 5px solid var(--wine);padding: 22px 24px}\n\n.step-item-header {display: flex;align-items: baseline;gap: 12px;margin-bottom: 6px}\n\n.step-order {font-size: 0.85rem;font-weight: 800;color: var(--wine);font-family: monospace}\n\n.step-item-title {font-size: 1.1rem;font-weight: 700;color: var(--wine-dark)}\n\n.step-item-body {font-size: 0.92rem;color: var(--ink-muted);line-height: 1.7}\n\n/* FAQ 主题分组 */\n.faq-groups-wrap {display: grid;grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 40px;margin-top: 40px}\n\n@media (min-width: 860px) {\n  .faq-groups-wrap {grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr}\n}\n\n.faq-group-block {background: var(--ivory-surface);padding: 32px 28px;border-top: 2px solid var(--wine)}\n\n.faq-group-title {font-size: 1.3rem;color: var(--wine-dark);margin-bottom: 24px;font-weight: 800;display: flex;align-items: center;gap: 10px}\n\n.faq-group-title span {font-size: 0.8rem;font-family: monospace;color: var(--accent-gold)}\n\n.faq-stack {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 18px}\n\n.faq-item {background: var(--ivory-card);border: 1px solid var(--ivory-border);border-left: 4px solid var(--wine);padding: 20px 22px}\n\n.faq-item h4 {font-size: 1.02rem;color: var(--wine-dark);margin-bottom: 8px;font-weight: 700}\n\n.faq-item p {font-size: 0.9rem;color: var(--ink-muted);line-height: 1.7}\n\n/* 专栏尾声结语 */\n.epilogue-box {border-top: 1px solid var(--ivory-border);border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ivory-border);padding: 48px 0;margin: 80px 0 40px;text-align: left}\n\n.epilogue-quote {font-size: 1.3rem;line-height: 1.8;color: var(--wine-dark);font-style: normal;max-width: 880px}\n\n.epilogue-author {margin-top: 16px;font-size: 0.85rem;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: var(--ink-muted)}\n\n/* 底部固定式文字导航 */\n.fixed-bottom-bar {position: fixed;bottom: 0;left: 0;width: 100%;background: var(--wine-dark);color: var(--ivory);border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);z-index: 9999;padding: 14px 20px;display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: center;backdrop-filter: blur(8px)}\n\n.fixed-bottom-brand {font-weight: 800;font-size: 1rem;letter-spacing: 0.08em;color: var(--ivory)}\n\n.fixed-bottom-links {display: flex;gap: 20px;list-style: none;font-size: 0.88rem;letter-spacing: 0.04em}\n\n.fixed-bottom-links a {color: var(--ivory);opacity: 0.85;transition: opacity 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease}\n\n.fixed-bottom-links a:hover {opacity: 1;color: #ffffff;text-decoration: underline}\n\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .masthead-stripe {font-size: 0.75rem}\n  .poster-hero {padding: 24px 16px 40px}\n  .essay-section {margin: 50px auto;padding: 0 16px}\n  .section-title {font-size: 1.6rem}\n  .fixed-bottom-bar {padding: 10px 14px}\n  .fixed-bottom-links {gap: 12px;font-size: 0.78rem}\n}\n</style><div class=\"masthead-stripe\">\n  <span>华云系统观察录 / 卷六</span>\n  <span>数据与路由规约</span>\n</div>\n\n<main>\n  \n  <header class=\"poster-hero\" id=\"preface\">\n    <div class=\"poster-meta\">\n      <span>拓扑纪元 / 通路札记</span>\n      <span>华南与海外跨境链路观测</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"poster-title-wrap\">\n      <h1 class=\"poster-title\">华云</h1>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"poster-subtext\">\n      <div class=\"poster-lead\">\n        网络连接不应当是无序的噪声堆叠。华云以经纬度般分明的逻辑，将异构节点的路由分发、带宽分配与加密规则收束为可度量的日常秩序。\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"poster-col-note\">\n        在这篇专栏记录中，我们抛弃惯常的夸饰与空洞许诺，将目光投向链路拓扑、订阅契约与客户端协议的实际解构。这是关于如何在一个不可预测的广域网中，维持一套平静、恒定且界限分明的通信基座。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  \n  <section class=\"essay-section\" id=\"philosophy\">\n    <span class=\"section-label\">Section 01 / 观察与准则</span>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">在分流与重组之间建立理性坐标</h2>\n    <div class=\"essay-prose\">\n      多数使用者对中继线路的误解，始于对瞬时峰值的盲目崇拜。然而长途跨国数据传输的真实挑战，从来不在于账面数字，而在于路由跃点的扰动控制、协议解析开销与规则分流的准确度。华云以此为出发点，构筑了一套由浅入深的访问架构。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"manifesto-grid\">\n      <article class=\"stripe-card\">\n        <div class=\"card-tag\">Principle 01</div>\n        <h3>确定性路由池</h3>\n        <p>不依赖未经甄别的公网跳板，华云将流量分类收口于受控的节点池内，保证基础连接与高阶任务各行其道，减少突发拥塞带来的抖动。</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"stripe-card\">\n        <div class=\"card-tag\">Principle 02</div>\n        <h3>规则分流机制</h3>\n        <p>通过精准的域名与 IP 规约判定，国内直连业务与跨境流转互不干扰，在降低不必要流量损耗的同时，维系本地访问的原生响应。</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"stripe-card\">\n        <div class=\"card-tag\">Principle 03</div>\n        <h3>透明的资源边界</h3>\n        <p>我们明确标定每一层级方案的并发终端数与吞吐上限，拒绝超售承诺，使个人研创与团队协作都能拥有可预期的带宽资源。</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section class=\"essay-section\" id=\"plans\">\n    <span class=\"section-label\">Section 02 / 阶梯方案与配额</span>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">按需递进的资源度量</h2>\n    <div class=\"essay-prose\">\n      连接需求并非单一维度。我们按照数据吞吐量、并发实体数量及专线保障深浅，设计了层级分明的阶梯方案。无论是个人查阅文献，还是团队集群的业务协同，都能在此找到适切的立足点。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"staircase-wrapper\">\n      \n      <div class=\"plan-card step-tier-1\">\n        <div class=\"plan-step-num\">TIER 01 / 探索起步</div>\n        <h3 class=\"plan-name\">基础版</h3>\n        <p class=\"plan-desc-note\">针对日常学术检索、基础文档同步与轻量跨境研读场景设计的标准配置。</p>\n        <div class=\"plan-price-box\">\n          <div class=\"plan-price\">¥15<span> /月</span></div>\n          <div class=\"plan-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥150/年</div>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"plan-features-list\">\n          <li>每月 100GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 3 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>解锁基础流媒体</li>\n          <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#setup\" class=\"plan-action-btn\">选定此阶梯</a>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div class=\"plan-card featured step-tier-2\">\n        <div class=\"plan-step-num\">TIER 02 / 核心主流</div>\n        <h3 class=\"plan-name\">旗舰版</h3>\n        <p class=\"plan-desc-note\">引入点对点专线转发，为重度流媒体回放、跨境低延迟协作提供平稳通道。</p>\n        <div class=\"plan-price-box\">\n          <div class=\"plan-price\">¥35<span> /月</span></div>\n          <div class=\"plan-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥350/年</div>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"plan-features-list\">\n          <li>每月 300GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n          <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n          <li>7x24 优先工单支持</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#setup\" class=\"plan-action-btn\">选定此阶梯</a>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div class=\"plan-card step-tier-3\">\n        <div class=\"plan-step-num\">TIER 03 / 集群协作</div>\n        <h3 class=\"plan-name\">团队版</h3>\n        <p class=\"plan-desc-note\">为工程研发小组、海外商务协作设计的高配额拓扑，支持精细路由调配。</p>\n        <div class=\"plan-price-box\">\n          <div class=\"plan-price\">¥85<span> /月</span></div>\n          <div class=\"plan-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥850/年</div>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"plan-features-list\">\n          <li>每月 1000GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 20 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n          <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n          <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#setup\" class=\"plan-action-btn\">选定此阶梯</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section class=\"essay-section\" id=\"setup\">\n    <span class=\"section-label\">Section 03 / 接入实践</span>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">通用规约与客户端导入流程</h2>\n    <div class=\"essay-prose\">\n      华云不强制绑定封闭软件，而是依托业界成熟的通用开源内核协议。无论您在 macOS、Windows、iOS、Android 还是 Linux 环境下，均可通过标准的订阅凭据完成分流拓扑配置。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"client-dispatch-panel\">\n      <div class=\"step-flow\">\n        <div class=\"step-item\">\n          <div class=\"step-item-header\">\n            <span class=\"step-order\">01</span>\n            <div class=\"step-item-title\">生成专用订阅令牌</div>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"step-item-body\">选定对应服务计划后，在系统控制台获取专属于您账户的标准化订阅链接。请妥善保存此串密钥，切勿公开发布。</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"step-item\">\n          <div class=\"step-item-header\">\n            <span class=\"step-order\">02</span>\n            <div class=\"step-item-title\">配置开源通用核心</div>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"step-item-body\">打开本地支持标准通用规则的客户端工具（如 Clash、Sing-box、Surge 或通用内核套件），将订阅链接录入配置中心。</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"step-item\">\n          <div class=\"step-item-header\">\n            <span class=\"step-order\">03</span>\n            <div class=\"step-item-title\">核验节点拓扑与规则</div>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"step-item-body\">拉取远程节点列表后，建议将分流模式切换为“规则判定（Rule）”，确保局域网与国内站点走直连通道，海外访问走匹配节点。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"stripe-card\">\n        <div class=\"card-tag\">System Notice</div>\n        <h3>客户端选型建议</h3>\n        <p>华云遵守纯粹中立的接入标准，不分发任何经过二次打包的第三方安装包。我们建议用户前往各大主流开源社区或应用商店，下载经过代码审计的官方发行版。</p>\n        <p>跨平台迁移时，仅需将同一组订阅分发文件导入新设备的客户端配置文件中即可生效，无需重新调整协议端口。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section class=\"essay-section\" id=\"faq\">\n    <span class=\"section-label\">Section 04 / 疑义辨析</span>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">常见问题与操作规约</h2>\n    <div class=\"essay-prose\">\n      技术工具应当具备明确的边界。以下我们针对架构运行、协议规则与账户账务等核心议题，梳理了系统性的答疑清单。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-groups-wrap\">\n      \n      <div class=\"faq-group-block\">\n        <h3 class=\"faq-group-title\">\n          <span>GROUP A</span> 协议特征与拓扑分流\n        </h3>\n        <div class=\"faq-stack\">\n          <article class=\"faq-item\">\n            <h4>华云目前适配哪些订阅分流协议？</h4>\n            <p>华云节点服务兼容主流的开源分流内核标准。订阅链接会自动下发对应客户端所支持的配置格式，无需手动逐一输入服务器参数。</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"faq-item\">\n            <h4>IPLC 专线与普通线路节点池的区别何在？</h4>\n            <p>普通节点池走公网国际出口链路，可能受公共海缆波动的客观影响；IPLC 专线则通过端到端的受保护内网通道传输，不经过公共公网滤网，抖动极低且延迟固定。</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"faq-item\">\n            <h4>为什么部分流媒体服务提示地区不符？</h4>\n            <p>流媒体平台对其 IP 库拥有自主判定规则。基础版节点池仅保证基础站点可达，若需稳定解除特定区域的媒体版权库限制，建议选用具备原生解锁属性的旗舰版或团队版节点。</p>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div class=\"faq-group-block\">\n        <h3 class=\"faq-group-title\">\n          <span>GROUP B</span> 账务周期与设备规约\n        </h3>\n        <div class=\"faq-stack\">\n          <article class=\"faq-item\">\n            <h4>月度流量配额的重置周期是如何计算的？</h4>\n            <p>流量周期依据您的订单生成日自动循环（如每月 15 日订购，则在次月 15 日重置）。未使用的当期流量不会累积至次月。</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"faq-item\">\n            <h4>设备同时在线数量是如何被检测与限制的？</h4>\n            <p>服务端根据实时发起数据握手的 IP 映射指纹进行并发计算。例如基础版允许 3 台设备，如果第 4 台设备在同一时间段发送请求，其连接会排队或被暂时挂起。</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"faq-item\">\n            <h4>年付方案是否可以在使用中途升阶？</h4>\n            <p>支持按剩余使用天数折算补足差价升级至更高阶梯方案。具体补差算法可在控制台工单中与系统支持专员确认。</p>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    \n    <div class=\"epilogue-box\">\n      <div class=\"epilogue-quote\">\n        “我们对网络的索求，终究会从对‘无所不能’的幻想，收敛为对‘稳定可控’的敬畏。华云所做的，只是为每一个坐在屏幕前的创作者，搭建一条安静延伸的桥梁。”\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"epilogue-author\">—— 华云网络架构备忘录 / 卷末</div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n\n<nav class=\"fixed-bottom-bar\" aria-label=\"全站导航\">\n  <div class=\"fixed-bottom-brand\">华云 HUA YUN</div>\n  <ul class=\"fixed-bottom-links\">\n    <li><a href=\"#preface\">序言</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"#philosophy\">准则</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"#plans\">阶梯方案</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"#setup\">配置接入</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"#faq\">答疑</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</nav>",
